.TH MYCAT 3 "June 2026" "Version 0.4.1" "Programmer's Manual"
.SH NAME
mycat \- custom utility library command for string and file operations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B client
[\fIoption\fP]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B client
program is a driver application that links against the custom
.I libmyutils
library. It demonstrates modular C programming by executing custom implementations of string manipulation functions (such as length, copy, and concatenation) and file analysis utilities (such as line/word/character counting and text pattern searching via grep).
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Zainab (Zainab-7989 on GitHub).